#: includes/class-bolt-edit-admin.php:260
msgid "We are going to build a custom WordPress theme that works with the Bolt Edit plugin. Bolt Edit has specific theme-building instructions that you must follow throughout the project. Find and read the complete instructions in WordPress admin under Bolt Edit > Get Started > For AI Agents, or locate docs/agent-instructions.md inside the active Bolt Edit plugin. If your environment cannot access them, ask me to copy them into this conversation."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bolt-edit-admin.php:265
msgid "Generate the website design and code inside the theme according to the prompt I provide. Build the first complete version and follow the Bolt Edit instructions throughout the project."
